# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker build context boundary — P17 H5 魅魔来袭
#
# Purpose: prevent secret, build artefact, log, and ephemeral debug files
#          from being sent to the Docker daemon during `docker build`.
#
# This file is independent of .gitignore:
#   - .gitignore controls what Git tracks
#   - .dockerignore controls what COPY/ADD uploads to the builder
#   - .cursorignore controls what Cursor indexes
#
# Missing or weak .dockerignore is a security boundary, not a convenience.
# Review every change that adds/expands a pattern.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── Source secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# SSH keys, deploy credentials, archived credentials
keys/
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.crt
*.cer
admin-pw.txt
admin-pw.*.txt
*.archived
*.archived.pem
.ssh/
.aws/
secrets/
service-account*.json

# ── Build artefacts & caches ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.github
.gitattributes

node_modules
.next
.next/
out
build
dist
coverage
.turbo
.cache
.tsbuildinfo
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Logs, temp, and ephemeral debug ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
logs/
tmp/
temp-*.mjs
temp-*.cjs
temp-*.py
*.bak
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*.orig
*.rej
*.old
.last-run.json

# ── Test & CI artefacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
test-results
playwright-report
.playwright
.nyc_output
bench-results.xml
junit*.xml
verify_result.json
verify_result.png

# ── Tooling-specific metadata ────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cursor
.cursorignore
.cursorrules
.idea
.vscode
agent-transcripts

# ── Source-owned paths that must NEVER end up inside the image ──────────────
# Deployment / SSH / hotfix scripts (use the production build artefact, not the
# deploy toolchain).
deploy.sh
scripts/_*
scripts/temp-*
scripts/_archive
H5 000
docs
ACTIVE_CONTEXT.md
CLEANUP_AUDIT.md

# ── Runtime uploads (created at runtime, not part of the source tree) ───────
public/uploads